<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl" data-theme="vintage">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>راوي التاريخ | أخبار وقصص تاريخية وموشن جرافيك</title>
  <meta name="description" content="منصة راوي التاريخ: أخبار الآثار، قصص الحضارات، أحداث في مثل هذا اليوم، وشروحات الموشن جرافيك التاريخية التفاعلية." />
  <meta name="keywords" content="راوي التاريخ, تاريخ, قصص تاريخية, في مثل هذا اليوم, موشن جرافيك تاريخي, آثار, حضارات" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="راوي التاريخ | أخبار وقصص من ذاكرة الزمن" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="اكتشف التاريخ بصياغة بصرية فاخرة وخرائط وموشن جرافيك تفاعلي." />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />

  <!-- الخطوط العربية الأصيلة -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <!-- البيانات المنظمة لمحركات البحث SEO JSON-LD -->
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "name": "راوي التاريخ",
    "inLanguage": "ar",
    "description": "منصة شاملة للأخبار والقصص التاريخية والموشن جرافيك التفاعلي"
  }
  </script>

  <style>
    :root,
    [data-theme="vintage"] {
      --bg-primary: #F6F1E7;
      --bg-secondary: #EDE4D3;
      --bg-card: #EFE7D8;
      --bg-elevated: #FAF6EE;
      --text-primary: #2B2118;
      --text-secondary: #685747;
      --accent: #9E7B3B;
      --accent-hover: #7D5E29;
      --accent-soft: rgba(158, 123, 59, 0.14);
      --seal-red: #7A2E2E;
      --border-subtle: rgba(104, 87, 71, 0.22);
      --shadow-card: 0 12px 30px -12px rgba(43, 33, 24, 0.14);
      --nav-glass: rgba(246, 241, 231, 0.88);
      --paper-opacity: 0.04;
      --hero-gradient: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(158, 123, 59, 0.15), transparent 60%);
    }

    [data-theme="dark"] {
      --bg-primary: #11100F;
      --bg-secondary: #181614;
      --bg-card: #1E1C19;
      --bg-elevated: #25221E;
      --text-primary: #ECE5D5;
      --text-secondary: #A59B8C;
      --accent: #C5A059;
      --accent-hover: #DCBA73;
      --accent-soft: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.15);
      --seal-red: #B24A4A;
      --border-subtle: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.2);
      --shadow-card: 0 16px 36px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
      --nav-glass: rgba(17, 16, 15, 0.88);
      --paper-opacity: 0.018;
      --hero-gradient: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.12), transparent 60%);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-primary);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-family: 'Noto Naskh Arabic', 'Cairo', system-ui, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.85;
      transition: background-color 0.35s ease, color 0.35s ease;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .paper-texture {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 90;
      opacity: var(--paper-opacity);
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    }

    h1, h2, h3, h4, .font-historical { font-family: 'Amiri', serif; line-height: 1.35; }
    .font-ui { font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    button { font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; border: none; background: none; color: inherit; }
    .container { width: min(1240px, 92%); margin-inline: auto; }

    .navbar {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50;
      background: var(--nav-glass);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      transition: background-color 0.35s ease;
    }
    .nav-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 76px; gap: 1rem; }
    .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; }
    .brand-seal {
      width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--accent); display: grid; place-items: center;
      background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent);
      font-family: 'Amiri', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.3rem;
    }
    .brand-text strong { display: block; font-family: 'Amiri', serif; font-size: 1.4rem; line-height: 1.1; }
    .brand-text span { font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-secondary); }

    .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .nav-links a { padding-block: 4px; color: var(--text-secondary); transition: color 0.25s; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    .nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.65rem; }

    .search-box { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; }
    .search-input {
      background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      color: var(--text-primary); padding: 0.42rem 2.1rem 0.42rem 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 999px; font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-size: 0.82rem;
      width: 175px; transition: width 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
    }
    .search-input:focus { outline: none; width: 225px; border-color: var(--accent); }
    .search-icon { position: absolute; right: 11px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-secondary); pointer-events: none; }

    .theme-btn {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem;
      padding: 0.45rem 0.95rem; border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600;
      transition: border-color 0.25s, transform 0.2s;
    }
    .theme-btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .mobile-menu-btn { display: none; font-size: 1.4rem; padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 8px; }

    .hero { position: relative; padding: 4.5rem 0 3.5rem; background-image: var(--hero-gradient); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); overflow: hidden; }
    .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 0.95fr; gap: 2.5rem; align-items: center; }
    .badge-seal {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem; border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--accent-soft); border: 1px solid var(--accent); color: var(--accent);
      font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
    }
    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.2vw, 3.4rem); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }
    .hero p { font-size: 1.08rem; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 58ch; margin-bottom: 1.8rem; }
    .hero-cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.9rem; }

    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem;
      background: var(--accent); color: #fff; padding: 0.75rem 1.55rem;
      border-radius: 10px; font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.92rem;
      transition: background 0.25s, transform 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); transform: translateY(-2px); }

    .btn-outline {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem;
      background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      color: var(--text-primary); padding: 0.75rem 1.4rem;
      border-radius: 10px; font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.92rem;
      transition: border-color 0.25s, transform 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--accent); transform: translateY(-2px); }

    .hero-visual {
      background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 18px; padding: 1.5rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    }
    .astrolabe-wrap {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #2a2118 0%, #120e0a 100%);
      display: grid; place-items: center; border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.35);
    }
    .astrolabe-ring { animation: slowSpin 48s linear infinite; transform-origin: center; }
    @keyframes slowSpin { from { transform: rotate(0deg); } to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
    .hero-visual-caption { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 1rem; font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-secondary); }

    .section { padding: 4rem 0; }
    .section-header { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-bottom: 1rem; }
    .section-title { font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 2.8vw, 2.25rem); }
    .section-subtitle { font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 0.25rem; }

    .otd-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; }
    .otd-card {
      background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.35rem; transition: transform 0.25s, border-color 0.25s;
    }
    .otd-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: var(--accent); }
    .otd-year {
      display: inline-block; font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft); padding: 0.15rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .otd-card h3 { font-size: 1.22rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .otd-card p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); }

    .era-filters { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem; margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
    .era-pill {
      padding: 0.45rem 1.15rem; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      background: var(--bg-card); font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-secondary); transition: all 0.25s;
    }
    .era-pill.active, .era-pill:hover { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border-color: var(--accent); }

    .timeline-strip { display: flex; gap: 1rem; overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2.2rem; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: var(--accent) transparent; }
    .timeline-node {
      min-width: 210px; background: var(--bg-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-top: 3px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 10px; padding: 0.95rem; flex-shrink: 0; cursor: pointer; transition: transform 0.2s;
    }
    .timeline-node:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .timeline-node span { font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-size: 0.76rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); }
    .timeline-node h4 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 0.25rem; }

    .stories-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
    .story-card {
      background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
      transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
    }
    .story-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); border-color: var(--accent); }
    .story-cover { height: 195px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: grid; place-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }
    .story-era-tag {
      position: absolute; top: 12px; right: 12px; background: rgba(17, 16, 15, 0.78);
      color: #EAE3D2; padding: 0.2rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 999px; font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.74rem; border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.45);
    }
    .story-body { padding: 1.35rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; }
    .story-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0.55rem; }
    .story-body h3 { font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 0.65rem; }
    .story-body p { font-size: 0.93rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1.2rem; flex: 1; }
    .read-more-btn { align-self: flex-start; color: var(--accent); font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.88rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; }
    .read-more-btn:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .cinema-section { background: #141210; color: #EAE3D2; padding: 4.5rem 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.25); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.25); }
    .cinema-section .section-subtitle { color: #A59B8C; }
    .motion-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(310px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
    .motion-card { background: #1E1B18; border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.22); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; transition: border-color 0.3s; }
    .motion-card:hover { border-color: #C5A059; }
    .video-facade { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: #0B0A09; overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer; }
    .play-circle {
      position: absolute; inset: 0; margin: auto; width: 62px; height: 62px; border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2px solid #C5A059; background: rgba(17, 16, 15, 0.72); display: grid; place-items: center;
      transition: transform 0.25s, background 0.25s;
    }
    .video-facade:hover .play-circle { transform: scale(1.1); background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.25); }
    .motion-info { padding: 1.2rem; }
    .motion-info span { font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-size: 0.74rem; color: #C5A059; }
    .motion-info h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-top: 0.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .motion-info p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #A59B8C; }

    .modal-overlay {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 80; background: rgba(10, 9, 8, 0.78);
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px); display: none; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 2rem 1rem; overflow-y: auto;
    }
    .modal-overlay.open { display: flex; }
    .article-modal {
      background: var(--bg-primary); color: var(--text-primary); width: min(860px, 100%);
      border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
      overflow: hidden; position: relative; animation: modalFade 0.3s ease;
    }
    @keyframes modalFade { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
    .reading-progress { position: sticky; top: 0; height: 4px; background: var(--accent); width: 0%; z-index: 10; transition: width 0.1s; }
    .modal-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); background: var(--bg-secondary); }
    .close-modal { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 1.15rem; }
    .close-modal:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
    .modal-body { padding: 2rem clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
    .modal-body h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.2vw, 2.45rem); margin-bottom: 1rem; }

    .historical-quote {
      margin: 1.6rem 0; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; border-right: 4px solid var(--accent);
      background: var(--bg-card); border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; font-family: 'Amiri', serif; font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    .historical-quote cite { display: block; margin-top: 0.5rem; font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--accent); font-style: normal; }

    .interactive-map-box { margin: 2rem 0; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.2rem; }
    .map-pin { cursor: pointer; transition: transform 0.2s; }
    .map-pin:hover { transform: scale(1.18); }
    .map-info-panel { margin-top: 0.85rem; padding: 0.85rem 1rem; background: var(--bg-elevated); border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); font-size: 0.9rem; }

    .motion-stage {
      width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: #0F0D0B; border-radius: 12px;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: grid; place-items: center; color: #EAE3D2; padding: 1.5rem; text-align: center;
    }
    .motion-animated-path { stroke-dasharray: 420; stroke-dashoffset: 420; animation: drawPath 4.5s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
    @keyframes drawPath { to { stroke-dashoffset: 0; } }

    .footer { padding: 3rem 0 2rem; background: var(--bg-secondary); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }
    .footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .newsletter-form { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 0.8rem; }
    .newsletter-form input {
      flex: 1; padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      background: var(--bg-primary); color: var(--text-primary); font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
    }

    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); transition: opacity 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), transform 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1); }
    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .reveal, .astrolabe-ring, .motion-animated-path { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .nav-links {
        display: none; position: absolute; top: 76px; right: 0; left: 0;
        background: var(--bg-primary); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        flex-direction: column; padding: 1.25rem; gap: 1rem;
      }
      .nav-links.open { display: flex; }
      .mobile-menu-btn { display: inline-block; }
      .search-box { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="paper-texture" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <header class="navbar">
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <a href="#hero" class="brand">
        <div class="brand-seal">ر</div>
        <div class="brand-text">
          <strong>راوي التاريخ</strong>
          <span>أخبار وقصص من ذاكرة الزمن</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
        <a href="#hero">الرئيسية</a>
        <a href="#on-this-day">في مثل هذا اليوم</a>
        <a href="#archive">أرشيف العصور</a>
        <a href="#stories">المجلة</a>
        <a href="#motion">الموشن جرافيك</a>
      </nav>

      <div class="nav-actions">
        <div class="search-box">
          <span class="search-icon">🔍</span>
          <input type="search" id="searchInput" class="search-input" placeholder="ابحث عن حدث أو عصر..." />
        </div>
        <button id="themeToggle" class="theme-btn" aria-label="تبديل المظهر">
          <span id="themeIcon">🌙</span>
          <span id="themeLabel">الوضع المظلم</span>
        </button>
        <button id="mobileMenuBtn" class="mobile-menu-btn" aria-label="القائمة">☰</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section id="hero" class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="reveal visible">
        <span class="badge-seal">📜 ملف العدد التفاعلي • العصر الإسلامي</span>
        <h1>كيف رسمت معركة القادسية خريطة العالم القديم في أربعة أيام؟</h1>
        <p>
          قراءة تاريخية معمّقة في منصة <strong>راوي التاريخ</strong> مدعومة بخرائط المسارات التفاعلية، ونصوص المؤرخين الأوائل،
          وشرح موشن جرافيك يوضح التكتيكات العسكرية التي غيّرت مجرى التاريخ في المشرق.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <button class="btn-primary" onclick="openStoryModal(1)">
            <span>📖</span> اقرأ القصة كاملة
          </button>
          <button class="btn-outline" onclick="openMotionModal('qadisiyyah')">
            <span>▶</span> شاهد ملخص الموشن جرافيك
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual reveal visible">
        <div class="astrolabe-wrap">
          <svg width="260" height="260" viewBox="0 0 260 260" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="130" cy="130" r="110" stroke="#C5A059" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-opacity="0.45" />
            <g class="astrolabe-ring">
              <circle cx="130" cy="130" r="92" stroke="#C5A059" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6 6" />
